  "note": "PTKP input normalization preserves recognized table keys, interprets incomplete K/ claims as K/0 and other unrecognized codes as TK/0 without unsupported dependency allowances, and applies the same normalization to supplied arrival-month status. Existing TER and annual calculations are retained; payment inputs represent qualifying amounts, additional insurance premiums exclude separately counted social-security premiums, and government aggregation uses the submitted primary-employer certificate."
